##CI/CD Pipeline

## How I configured the pipeline
- Installed Jenkins on Windows using the jenkins.war file
- Configured a Freestyle project in Jenkins
- Set up build steps to run npm install, npm run build, and npm test
- Used Jest with jest-junit for unit testing
- Connected the pipeline to the local project directory

## Challenges faced
- Jenkins plugin installation failed due to unstable mobile data connection
- Resolved DNS issues by manually downloading and installing .hpi plugin files
- Fixed branch specifier from master to main for GitHub integration
- Used local project path instead of GitHub checkout due to network limitations

